    "summary": "A man&#039;s (?) shirt with long sleeves; woven cotton patterning; seams hand stitched with red cotton yarn.  Ground made of natural cream tabby cotton cloth; hand spun and hand woven.  Centre front opening; round neckline; straight sleeves set in at right angles; gap left under arm.  Three red, green and black zigzag bands on arms.  Further zigzag, and diamond patterning, both bands and stripes on back; worked in discontinuous supplementary warp and weft.  Fastened with single white circular ceramic (?) button.",
